2026-07-27T12:54:55.0317220Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:54:55.0317986Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:54:55.0319128Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:54:55.0320388Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
